window.bookSummaryJSON = "It is called Crota...and it has awakened. Sheriff Skip Harding is called out to investigate a double homicide unlike any he has seen before. The bodies have been torn to pieces in the woods. Some think it's a bear. But others whisper something different. \"It is the Crota,\" they say, - the great beast of Native American legend that one day will reawaken. Now that day has arrived."; 
